    <p class="lead text-white">Sistema de gerenciamento de vendas construído em C# e .NET Core.</p>
</div>

<hr class="border-info mb-5" />

<div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-md-8">
        <div class="custom-table-bg p-5 rounded shadow-sm text-center">

            <h3 class="text-warning mb-3">@ViewData["Message"]</h3>
